  "[action] (to Chen Fu, the second son) eldest son returns with wife",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"And I have a wife of a rich merchant's daughter, and I am an officer among the rich men of the town.\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"And what have you had for dinner?\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"And what have you had for dinner?\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"And what have you eaten?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"We have had a dinner of rice and fish and greens, and I have a wife and children and servants and money enough to buy what I want, and I have a house and land and sons and daughters and a wife and a home, and my father has a son and a son and a son, and we have a father and a home, and we are rich and happy.\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"And and and and and---\"",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"And we are rich and happy.\"",
